# Device syslog captures: system-wide, may contain data from other apps.
# Ignore everything else added to logs/ by default (captures, ad-hoc screenshots), and
# explicitly re-track the one screenshot already committed as evidence in IOS-BUILD.md.
logs/*
!logs/photo_2026-08-24_21-26-45.jpg

# Scratch spool from the desktop harness. One of these was committed by accident and
# held the OLD flat wire shape, which is the exact bug tests/test_protocol.py exists to
# prevent -- a stray fixture that contradicts the protocol is worse than no fixture.
.tmp-spool/
